/*
 * Header 2 format
 *
 * +0              +2               +7                  +11               +15
 * +---------------+----------------+-------------------+-----------------+
 * |header size(*1)|compression type|compressed size(*2)|uncompressed size|
 * +---------------+----------------+-------------------+-----------------+
 *  <--------------------------------(*1)---------------------------------*
 *
